      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I jumped too quickly on making a canny, It seems focus view is fine. the scrolling was being forced by input field having scroll sensitivity set to 1 by default (unity hides this in inspector which caused the confusion, I found it by going into debug mode and changing it to 0). That mixed in with a few adjustments on the text helped fix the issue. I enabled focus view back on after too and it didn't cause any unintended effects.\n\nSorry about this, if this canny can be deleted, that;d be great :)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
