  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "On UI that has text blocks and such that scroll up and down, having focus view enabled results in a conflict as attempting to scroll the UI will pan the focus view along with it\n\niPhone 15 Pro Max, iOS 18 Beta 5",
